<section class="brochure-five-button-page">
    <h3>About EmailMoney.App (EMA - pronounced ee-mah))</h3>
    <p>In Canada, e-Transfers and Pre-Authorized Debits are now very common methods of giving in the non-profit sector.</p>
    <p>The problem is that manual work is required to capture and record each donation accurately.</p>
    <p><strong>We have an app for that!</strong></p>
    <p>EmailMoney.App (EMA) is built to automate the processing of both e-Transfers and Pre-Authorized Debits, reducing administrative burden and improving accuracy.</p>
    <h3>EMA comes in two versions:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>EMA Giving</strong> — an economical, lightweight donation management system for small to midsize nonprofits without automation, or feel the program that they have is too expensive and/or not fitting their needs.</li>
        <li><strong>EMA eTran</strong> — automated e-Transfer and PAD processing for nonprofits that have a ChMS or fundraising platform, but are looking for more efficiency in their office.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Built in Canada</h3>
    <p>EMA ChMS prints tax receipts which are fully CRA-compliant</p>
    <h3>Governance</h3>
    <p>We value transparency and auditability.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Every donor and donation is fully audited — who changed what, and when</li>
        <li>Audit data is always visible and accessible to the donor and the non-profit</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Founders’ Note</h3>
    <p>
        Our founders are retirement-age professionals who understand the value of doing things right the first time.
        Each of us brings decades of experience in IT and/or nonprofit operations. We aren’t a “move fast and break things” startup;
        we are a “measure twice, cut once” partner for your ministry.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/faqs">Frequently Asked Questions</a></p>
</section>
